From 42162541848d94c36c1ad657c01da06c04cced5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 13:24:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] hostapd: let wpad hear udebug appear

B55, from openwrt/openwrt#26469 (branch b55-wpad-acl-object-add) as it stands, its
PKG_RELEASE changes replaced by the port's own bumps.

hostapd and wpa_supplicant take their udebug ring config through a
libubus subscriber with new_obj_cb, which registers for the
ubus.object.add event so that it can subscribe to the udebug object
whenever it appears. They run as the network user, whose ACL has no
listen entry, so ubusd refuses that registration, and libubus does not
report it. They find udebugd only through the lookup at their own start:

- udebugd started after them, as when it is installed on a running
  system, is never found, and they keep no rings until wpad restarts.
- After udebugd restarts, their rings attach again, but they no longer
  get config changes: a ring turned on or off stays as it was.

Allow listening for ubus.object.add.

Tested on an Arista W-118 (ipq40xx), udebug.hostapd enabled with
wpa_nl_rx:
- before: udebugd installed after hostapd started kept the config, and
  hostapd had no ring; after a udebugd restart, turning wpa_nl_tx on
  made no ring.
- after: with udebugd started after hostapd, hostapd made wpa_log,
  wpa_nl_rx and wpa_nl_tx, and wpa_supplicant its wpa_log; after a
  udebugd restart, wpa_nl_ctrl turned on appeared, and wpa_nl_tx turned
  off went away.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christopher Griffin <christophergriffin05@gmail.com>
---
 package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile            | 2 +-
 package/network/services/hostapd/files/wpad_acl.json | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile b/package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile
index 8e31027bbc5..22fe5fa579f 100644
--- a/package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile
+++ b/package/network/services/hostapd/Makefile
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
 PKG_NAME:=hostapd
-PKG_RELEASE:=15
+PKG_RELEASE:=16
 
 PKG_SOURCE_URL:=https://w1.fi/hostap.git
 PKG_SOURCE_PROTO:=git
diff --git a/package/network/services/hostapd/files/wpad_acl.json b/package/network/services/hostapd/files/wpad_acl.json
index 8719affe01e..54785a408ba 100644
--- a/package/network/services/hostapd/files/wpad_acl.json
+++ b/package/network/services/hostapd/files/wpad_acl.json
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@
 		}
 	},
 	"subscribe": [ "udebug" ],
+	"listen": [ "ubus.object.add" ],
 	"publish": [ "hostapd", "hostapd.*", "wpa_supplicant", "wpa_supplicant.*", "hostapd-auth" ],
 	"send": [ "bss.*", "wps_credentials" ]
 }
